# Play test of Sun Atoll (CIPlay sun_atoll, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the west islet's trench
# between the blockhouse and the bunker (floor 0.8 m) from the ocean beach to the lagoon, the blockhouse's door in its
# north wall (the opening x -32.4..-31.1, z 13 - 1.3 m wide: walks go through its middle), the bunker's in its south wall
# (x -29.7..-28.4, z 16), both rooms under slabs (3.9 m); ground zero in the lagoon's middle (its rim 0.7 m down, the
# crater 9.5 m down); the north post at 5 35.5 (3.9 m) and the south post at 2 -35 (3.5 m), each fenced, a ramp from its
# gate down into the lagoon; the ring of islets walked between them.
island Sun Atoll
expect step 0
expect title Shot Juniper
wait 5

# Ashore up the ramp from the ocean, along the trench to the blockhouse's door: the blockhouse; in, her notebook on the
# desk. The projector has no films yet and the safe stays shut
walk -42.5 14.5 to -38 14.5 to -31.8 14.5 h=0.9
zone blockhouse
expect step 0
walk -31.8 14.5 to -31.8 12 to -33 10 h=0.9 below=3.5
read Dr. Varga's notebook
expect step 1
use projector
expect message threaded with nothing
open Blockhouse safe
expect message wired to the projector
expect step 1
walk -33 10 to -32.5 6.5 to -31.5 5.6 h=0.9 below=3.5
reach Blockhouse supply crate
open Blockhouse supply crate
expect item Bolt 4

# Out across the trench into the instrument bunker: the roaches and the big one; her dosimeter in the locker - the
# ticking out over the crater from then on
walk -31.5 5.6 to -32.5 6.5 to -33 10 to -31.8 12 to -31.8 14.5 to -29 14.5 to -29 18 h=0.9 below=3.5
zone bunker
kill Roach
expect step 2
walk -29 18 to -27 19 h=0.9 below=3.5
reach Instrument locker
open Instrument locker
expect story dosimeter 1
expect step 3
expect shown geiger

# Out to ground zero in the lagoon: the stumps; down in the crater the tower camera's lead case (film 1); the sunken barrel
zone groundzero
expect step 4
open Tower camera's lead case
expect story film 1
expect step 5
open Sunken barrel

# The north post: out of the water up its ramp, in at the gate - the camera box (film 2)
walk 3.5 23 to 3.5 29 to 3.5 31.5 to 3.5 33 h=3.9
reach North post camera box
open North post camera box
expect story film 2

# Along the ring: east over the north islet to the east islet's beached barrel, south to the palm's stash, on to the south
# post - the camera box (film 3) - and down its ramp into the lagoon
walk 3.5 33 to 3.5 31 to 10 31 to 18 28 to 24 26 to 30 22 to 31 15 to 35.2 9 h=3
reach Beached supply barrel
open Beached supply barrel
walk 35.2 9 to 36 2 to 37 -4 to 35 -10 to 31 -14 to 25.8 -19.6 h=3.7
reach Box under the palm
open Box under the palm
walk 25.8 -19.6 to 20 -27 to 12 -31 to 3.5 -30.5 to 3.5 -32.8 h=3.5
reach South post camera box
open South post camera box
expect story film 3
expect step 6
walk 3.5 -32.8 to 3.5 -30 to 3.5 -25 to 3.5 -23 h=0

# Back to the blockhouse from the lagoon, in at the trench's lagoon end: the films run on the projector, the safe opens
walk -22.5 14.5 to -29 14.5 to -31.8 14.5 to -31.8 12 to -33 9.5 h=0.9
use projector
expect message films flicker
expect story film 0
open Blockhouse safe
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_Recycler 1
expect done
